  - kind: 2
    emotion: whisper
    text: Son, have you heard what happened down at the pier? The night boatmen swear
      a pike as big as a hog stuck its head out of the water and cursed the foreman
      in plain speech! Put it in the paper so folk stay off the docks!
    giftId: 
    amount: 1
    optionA: Leave the note here.
